  "description": "Vincent, the agent of destiny, and Rue, the guardian, deliver presents to children around the world. These presents, known as 'the box of destiny' affect people's lives differently depending on the person's choice. The rule is that the agents must not interfere with the fate that the box brings, however, the warm-hearted Vincent often finds himself breaking the rules. One day, Detective Argio, who's been investigating a 30-year-old kidnapping case, meets Vincent, who looks strangely similar to a culprit he used to know. As Argio tries to uncover the mysteries behind Vincent, a new case of a missing child occurs and the evidences keep pointing towards Vincent as the prime suspect...\n\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
